":"list_standards_packs","does":"List the standards packs (`kshana standards-pack list`): scored scenario sets for the DHS Resilient PNT framework test profiles, IMO MSC.1/Circ.1575 and ICAO Doc 9849 Appendix F, each with the bars it states before the run and the compliance rows it supports evidence for."},{"name":"lunanet_afs_check","does":"Check the LunaNet Augmented Forward Signal (AFS) against the published specification, pinned to LNIS Version 5 Applicable Document 1 Volume A (LSIS-AFS V1.0, 29 January 2025) (`kshana lunanet-afs-check`, docs/LUNANET-AFS.md)."},{"name":"referee_location_score","does":"Score where a monitoring network said interference came from (`kshana jammertest locate-score`, 0.41 row B2): per report the event it belongs to (by id, or by time window and nearest truth), the horizontal geodesic error and vertical error, and for each region (an ellipse with its covariance, a polygon or grid cells) whether it contains the truth and its area; per event and pooled the median and 90th-percentile error, coverage per level with its binomial check, median region size, time to first location and time to locate within 100 m, 500 m, 1 km and 5 km; and false locations per hour of clean time."},{"name":"render_leaderboard","does":"Render kshana-bench result files (`kshana bench leaderboard`) as the static leaderboard page, HTML text in the reply: `results` is a list of `kshana-bench-result/1` JSON texts (at most 256, 4 MiB each), each validated first; a file scored under another major spec version is refused because results of different major versions are never put in one table."},{"name":"report_scenario","does":"Run a Kshana scenario and return its report: an executive summary, the inputs, every result figure with its unit and its VALIDATED or MODELLED label, the events, the capability rows the run exercised, and a reproducibility record (engine version, scenario and result SHA-256 digests, seed, the command that reproduces it)."},{"name":"route_exposure"